('madhvacharya-sc:source:11.24','Madhvācārya','gita.11.24','sa','commentary','।।11.24।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.,'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:11.25','Madhvācārya','gita.11.25','sa','commentary','।।11.25।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.,'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:11.26','Madhvācārya','gita.11.26','sa','commentary','।।11.26।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.,'),
