('madhvacharya-sc:source:11.49','Madhvācārya','gita.11.49','sa','commentary','।।11.49।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:11.50','Madhvācārya','gita.11.50','sa','commentary','।।11.50।।स्वकं रूपं तु भ्रान्तिप्रतीत्या। अन्यथा तदपि स्वकमेव। प्रमाणानि तूक्तानि पुरस्तात्।'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:11.51','Madhvācārya','gita.11.51','sa','commentary','।।11.51।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.,'),
