('madhvacharya-sc:source:18.62','Madhvācārya','gita.18.62','sa','commentary','।।18.62।।परोक्षवचनं तु द्रोणं प्रति भीमवचनवत्।'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:18.63','Madhvācārya','gita.18.63','sa','commentary','।।18.63।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.,'),
