('madhvacharya-sc:source:18.65','Madhvācārya','gita.18.65','sa','commentary','।।18.65।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:18.66','Madhvācārya','gita.18.66','sa','commentary','।।18.66।।धर्मत्यागः फलत्यागः। कथमन्यथा युद्धविधिः।यस्तु कर्मफलत्यागी स त्यागीत्यभिधीयते [18।11] इति चोक्तम्।'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:18.67','Madhvācārya','gita.18.67','sa','commentary','।।18.67।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.,'),
('madhvacharya-sc:source:18.68','Madhvācārya','gita.18.68','sa','commentary','।।18.68।।Sri Madhvacharya did not comment on this sloka.,'),
